# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Redirects for the CamKIT site. Read by Cloudflare Pages and Netlify.
# Same portability caveat as _headers: GitHub Pages ignores this file.
#
# docs/ is maintainer documentation and is .gitignore'd, so it never reaches
# the host and the rule below should never fire. It is kept as a safety net:
# if docs/ is ever un-ignored, committed by accident, or copied to a server by
# hand, this stops it becoming Google-indexable pages on a clinical domain.
# What it holds — an internal runbook with a stale deploy status, and the
# survey design rationale plus ethics reasoning — reads badly in public and
# could bias a respondent who finds it.
#
# Deployers: the two things you genuinely need are duplicated where they
# cannot be missed — the CSP rollout in _headers, the font regeneration recipe
# in assets/tokens.css.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

/docs/*  /  302
